### Sesión: PERFIL y PERMISOS (modalidad JWT, sin RBAC)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api

# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/session/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "planta",
  "password": "Planta2026!"
}

### perfil: identidad pública y roles activos (nunca password) -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/session/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### permisos efectivos: la misma consulta que authorize (PLANTA -> 13)
GET {{baseUrl}}/session/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### sin token -> 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/session/profile
